* ============================================================================
* 00_master.do — llm_peer 复现包编排主脚本 (replication orchestrator)
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}  (LLM-Generated Peer Competition IV, Cao et al. 2025 RAS)
* 生成自: news_process.papers._common.stata_runner.build_replication_package
